/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-76-  // ==== While ==============================================================
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-77-  rule <k> While(C:Expr, B:Stmts) => #while(C, B) ... </k>
